      "markdown": "Intercom On Steroids 🔥\n\n# Your Support OnAutoPilot\n\nDeploy an AI sales assistant that converts 24/7. Never miss a lead, answer questions instantly, and close deals while you sleep.\n\nCreate Demo Bot\n\n[Or sign up to manage your bots →](https://deskforce.co.za/auth?signup=true)\n\n## Powerful Features, Simple Interface\n\nOur intelligent scraping technology turns your website content into a powerful knowledge base powered by advanced AI.\n\n### Intelligent Web Scraping\n\nOur advanced scraping technology extracts content from your entire website, including subpages and hidden content.\n\n### Knowledge Base Creation\n\nAutomatically organize and structure your website content into a comprehensive knowledge base.\n\n### AI-Powered Understanding\n\nOur advanced algorithms understand the context and relationships between different pieces of content.\n\n### Instant Support Bot\n\nInstantly transform your knowledge base into a chat support bot that can answer customer questions.\n\n### Privacy Focused\n\nWe prioritize your data security. Your website content is processed securely and never shared.\n\n### Custom Branding\n\nPersonalize your support bot with your brand colors, logo, and messaging to create a seamless experience.\n\n## How It Works\n\nFour simple steps to create your intelligent support bot\n\n1\n\n### Import your Data\n\nTrain your AI from various data sources: websites, PDFs, and more.\n\n2\n\n### Customize\n\nSetup your agent persona and goals. Customize to fit your brand perfectly.\n\n3\n\n### Deploy\n\nAdd your chatbot to your website or existing tools in just a few clicks.\n\n4\n\n### Monitor\n\nMonitor conversations and take over when needed with intelligent handoff.\n\n## Ready to Transform Your Website?\n\nEnter your website URL above to create an intelligent support bot in minutes. No coding required, just pure AI magic.\n\n[Get Started Free](https://deskforce.co.za/auth?signup=true) [Sign In](https://deskforce.co.za/auth)",
